---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "成都旅行指南：熊猫、美食与慢生活";
const description = "成都完全指南——大熊猫、川菜和悠闲生活方式，这座来了就不想走的城市。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/cities/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        返回城市指南
      </a>
    </nav>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏙️ 成都</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">成都旅行指南：熊猫、美食与慢生活</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">成都完全指南——大熊猫、川菜和悠闲生活方式，这座来了就不想走的城市。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读时间：7分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-50 to-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-pink-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-pink-900 mb-4">⚡ 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-pink-800 leading-relaxed">成都是<strong>大熊猫的故乡</strong>和川菜的中心。但这座城市真正特别之处在于它的生活方式——成都人悠闲自在，热爱泡茶馆、打麻将。成都位于被称为\"天府之国\"的富饶成都平原，拥有3000多年历史，同时也在快速发展现代化。对三国迷来说，武侯祠是必到之处。而最重要的是，成都是世界上能最近距离看大熊猫的地方。</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 本指南目录</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#why-visit" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🐼 为什么要去成都</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-many-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📅 需要几天</a></li>
        <li><a href="#attractions" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎯 热门景点</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 市内交通</a></li>
        <li><a href="#where-to-stay" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏨 住在哪里</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-to-eat" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍜 吃什么</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="why-visit" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🐼 为什么要去成都</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">成都被誉为\"天府之国\"，是一座拥有3000多年历史的古都，同时兼具现代魅力。这里有全球最大的大熊猫繁育研究基地，是少数能近距离看大熊猫的地方之一。作为川菜发源地，麻婆豆腐、担担面等世界名菜都诞生于此。成都人珍视用\"安逸\"来形容的悠闲生活方式——泡茶馆、吃火锅是这座城市的文化传统。对于历史爱好者来说，三国文化的圣地巡礼也极具吸引力。</p>

    <h2 id="how-many-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">📅 需要几天</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>2-3天（标准）：</strong>熊猫基地、武侯祠、锦里、宽窄巷子，品尝川菜</li>
      <li><strong>4-5天（宽松）：</strong>峨眉山或乐山大佛一日游，登上青城山</li>
      <li><strong>6天以上（深度）：</strong>前往九寨沟、黄龙等四川自然奇观</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- ==================== ATTRACTIONS ==================== -->
    <h2 id="attractions" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🎯 热门景点</h2>

    <!-- Panda Base -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/chengdu/panda-base.webp" alt="成都大熊猫繁育研究基地的大熊猫" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">成都大熊猫繁育研究基地</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">全球最大、最负盛名的大熊猫保护研究机构，生活着100多只大熊猫和小熊猫。在这里你可以看到从刚出生的熊猫宝宝到成年大熊猫各个年龄段的熊猫。上午是熊猫最活跃的时间，能看到它们吃竹子、玩耍的样子。游览最佳时间是开园后立即入园（早上7:30），可以避开人流高峰，在凉爽的时段看到熊猫最活泼的一面。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Wuhou Shrine -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/chengdu/wuhou-shrine.webp" alt="武侯祠，三国圣地" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">武侯祠</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">纪念三国时期蜀汉丞相诸葛亮的祠庙，是三国迷的朝圣地。优美的园林和历史建筑让人沉浸在三国历史之中。祠内陈列着蜀汉英雄塑像，以及《出师表》等著名碑文。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Jinli & Kuanzhai -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/chengdu/jinli.webp" alt="锦里古街的红灯笼" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">锦里 & 宽窄巷子</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">成都最具代表性的历史文化街区。锦里毗邻武侯祠，是一条清代风格的商业街，红灯笼高挂，古色古香，两旁是各种纪念品店、小吃摊和茶馆。宽窄巷子由宽巷子、窄巷子和井巷子三条平行巷子组成，保留了传统川西建筑风貌，现已成为汇集咖啡馆、餐厅和艺术画廊的时尚地标。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Du Fu Cottage -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/chengdu/dufu-cottage.webp" alt="杜甫草堂园林" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">杜甫草堂</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">唐代大诗人杜甫流寓成都时居住4年的茅屋旧址扩建而成的博物馆。翠竹掩映、清幽雅致的园林中，陈列着杜甫生平与作品展览。对中国诗歌和文化感兴趣的游客不容错过。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mount Qingcheng -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/chengdu/qingchengshan.webp" alt="青城山的道教宫观与翠绿山林" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">青城山 & 都江堰</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">从成都出发可一日往返的世界文化遗产。青城山是道教发源地之一，素有\"青城天下幽\"的美誉。都江堰则是2200多年前建成的古代水利工程，至今仍在发挥灌溉作用，是令人惊叹的工程奇迹。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sichuan Opera -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/chengdu/sichuan-opera.webp" alt="川剧变脸表演" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">川剧 & 变脸</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">川剧是四川传统戏曲，其中\"变脸\"绝技闻名世界。演员在瞬间变换五彩斑斓的脸谱，令人叹为观止。成都有多家剧院上演川剧，是游客喜爱的夜间活动。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🚇 市内交通</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>地铁：</strong>成都地铁发展迅速，覆盖大部分主要景点。有英文标识。详情见<a href="/zh/transport/metro-bus/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">中国主要城市地铁公交指南</a>。</li>
      <li><strong>滴滴：</strong>市内到处可用，很方便。设置方法见<a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">外国人在中国使用滴滴指南</a>。</li>
      <li><strong>出租车：</strong>价格实惠，容易打到。</li>
      <li><strong>共享单车：</strong>成都地势平坦，非常适合骑行。共享单车遍布全城，探索街巷很轻松。</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="where-to-stay" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏨 住在哪里</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">锦里/武侯祠区域——首次游客首选</h3><p class="text-gray-700">历史文化氛围浓厚，靠近主要景点。在传统韵味中体验成都。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">春熙路区域——购物首选</h3><p class="text-gray-700">成都核心商圈，从高档酒店到经济型住宿选择丰富。地铁交通便利。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">宽窄巷子区域——文化体验首选</h3><p class="text-gray-700">保留传统川西建筑的街区，特色精品酒店和民宿众多。夜晚散步氛围极佳。</p></div>

    <!-- ==================== WHAT TO EAT ==================== -->
    <h2 id="what-to-eat" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🍜 吃什么</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">川菜之魂在成都。麻辣鲜香的各色菜肴令全球食客为之倾倒。</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-3">
          <img src="/images/chengdu/food/mapo-tofu.webp" alt="麻婆豆腐" class="max-w-full max-h-56 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">麻婆豆腐</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base">川菜的代表之作。嫩豆腐与猪肉末、豆瓣酱、花椒一同烧制，花椒的麻和辣椒的辣相得益彰。白米饭上浇一勺，是成都人最熟悉的味道。城里随处可吃，但陈麻婆豆腐总店最为正宗。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-3">
          <img src="/images/chengdu/food/dandan-noodles.webp" alt="担担面" class="max-w-full max-h-56 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">担担面</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base">起源于街边担担小贩的成都名面。细面条上浇着猪肉末、芽菜、葱花、芝麻酱、花椒和红油调制的酱料。甜、辣、麻的平衡恰到好处，一口就能尝到川味的精髓。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-3">
          <img src="/images/chengdu/food/huoguo.webp" alt="四川火锅" class="max-w-full max-h-56 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">四川火锅</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base">成都饮食文化的精髓。沸腾的麻辣红油锅中涮入薄肉片、蔬菜、豆腐、菌菇等食材，蘸香油碟食用。四川特有的香油碟能缓解辣度，增添风味。本地人喜欢就着啤酒或酸梅汤吃上几个小时。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-3">
          <img src="/images/chengdu/food/chuanchuan.webp" alt="串串香" class="max-w-full max-h-56 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">串串香</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base">火锅的串串版，成都特有的街头美食。各类食材串在竹签上，自己放入麻辣汤底中烫熟。按竹签数量计费，可以轻松尝试各种食材。从路边摊到专门店，城中随处可见。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="not-prose mt-16">
          <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-5 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">📚 继续阅读</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="/zh/cities/city-select/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🗺️ 中国旅行需要几天
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/zh/cities/guangzhou-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🏙️ 广州旅行指南
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/zh/transport/high-speed-rail/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🚄 中国高铁预订与乘坐指南
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              💳 中国支付方式指南
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
